; Export forwarding table for the x64 emulation side of MoqiTextServiceARM64X.dll.
; The x64 exports must forward to the plain x64 MoqiTextServiceX64.dll placed
; next to the forwarder in System32 on ARM64 Windows. The x64 DLL itself is
; never registered; it is only reached through the ARM64X forwarder when an
; x64 emulation process loads the IME.

EXPORTS
    DllGetClassObject = MoqiTextServiceX64.dll.DllGetClassObject
    DllCanUnloadNow   = MoqiTextServiceX64.dll.DllCanUnloadNow
    DllRegisterServer = MoqiTextServiceX64.dll.DllRegisterServer
    DllUnregisterServer = MoqiTextServiceX64.dll.DllUnregisterServer
